        new Quote { Id = "https://en.wikiquote.org/wiki/Ahdaf_Soueif", Text = "Maybe not a hydra because that’s really, really nasty. I think there was almost a false head: we ripped open the packaging and now we’re faced with the real thing that’s there in the box…", Author = "Ahdaf Soueif" },
